# 🎓 CampusMind — Smart Campus Management System

Minimal campus management platform. **Zero dependencies.** Pure Python stdlib + SQLite + HTML/CSS/JS.

## Quick Start

```bash
./start.sh
# or
python app.py
```

Open http://localhost:8000

## Features

- **Auth** — Register/Login with session cookies, PBKDF2 password hashing
- **Roles** — Student, Teacher, Admin
- **Courses** — Create, enroll, manage
- **Routine** — Weekly class schedule
- **Attendance** — QR/code-based sessions, bunk calculator, stats
- **Results** — Marks entry, auto grade calculation, CGPA
- **Syllabus** — Topic tracker with completion status
- **Notifications** — Per-user notification system
- **AI Assistant** — Rule-based Bangla/English query bot

## Assistant Queries

| Query | Response |
|-------|----------|
| `amar kal ki class?` | Tomorrow's classes |
| `amar attendance koto?` | Attendance stats |
| `CSE-301 er teacher ke?` | Course teacher |
| `amar cgpa koto?` | CGPA calculation |
| `amar result dekhao` | Recent results |

Works in both Bangla and English.

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|-----------|
| Backend | Python stdlib (`http.server`, `sqlite3`, `hashlib`, `hmac`) |
| Frontend | Plain HTML + CSS + vanilla JS |
| Database | SQLite |
| Auth | PBKDF2 + signed session cookies |

**No frameworks. No npm. No pip install. Just Python.**

## Structure

```
Campus-Mind/
├── app.py           # Server + routing + all logic
├── static/
│   ├── style.css    # All styles
│   └── app.js       # Client-side JS
├── campusmind.db    # SQLite database (auto-created)
├── start.sh
└── README.md
```

